What you know about fear...doesn't even come close.

2
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:54,000
The Texas Chainsaw Massacre is a horror film directed by Marcus Nispel.

3
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:48,000
After picking up a traumatized young hitchhiker, five friends find themselves stalked and hunted
by a chainsaw-wielding killer and his family of equally psychopathic killers.

4
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:42,000
Erin Hardesty, played by Jessica Biel.

5
00:24:30,000 --> 00:24:36,000
Morgan, played by Jonathan Tucker.

6
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:30,000
Thomas Hewitt (Leatherface), played by Andrew Bryniarski.

7
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:24,000
Pepper, played by Erica Leerhsen.

8
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:18,000
Kemper, played by Eric Balfour.

9
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:12,000
Andy, played by Mike Vogel.

10
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
The Texas Chainsaw Massacre is a 2003 American slasher film serving as a remake of Tobe Hooper's 1974 film The
Texas Chain Saw Massacre, and the fifth installment in The Texas Chainsaw Massacre franchise.

11
00:53:54,000 --> 00:54:00,000
It was directed by Marcus Nispel (in his feature directorial debut), written
by Scott Kosar, and produced by Michael Bay and Mike Fleiss.

12
00:58:48,000 --> 00:58:54,000
The film's ensemble cast includes Jessica Biel, Jonathan Tucker,
Erica Leerhsen, Mike Vogel, Eric Balfour, and R.

13
01:03:42,000 --> 01:03:48,000
Like its source material, the plot follows a group of young adults traveling
through rural Texas who encounter Leatherface and his murderous family.

14
01:08:36,000 --> 01:08:42,000
Several crew members of the original film were involved with the project: Hooper and writer Kim Henkel served as co-producers,
Daniel Pearl returned as cinematographer, and John Larroquette reprised his voice narration for the opening intertitles.

15
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
The film was released in the United States on October 17, 2003, received mixed reviews from
critics, and grossed $107 million at the box office on a budget of $9.5 million.

16
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
A prequel was released in 2006, subtitled The Beginning.

17
01:23:18,000 --> 01:23:24,000
The Texas Chainsaw Massacre was the first film to be produced by Platinum Dunes, who
would go on to produce remakes of several other 20th-century horror films.

18
01:28:12,000 --> 01:28:18,000
The film explores themes of suicide, sheriff, psychopath, trauma, telephone.

19
01:33:06,000 --> 01:33:12,000
The tone is dark.
